Not touched, by instruction: the other MINOR findings (R5-F2 to R5-F23) stay as notes. The summary row for `worktree list` and `worktree current` in section 4 (`docs/designs/orchestrator-mode.md:342`) was not extended, because the finding names only the two places above; it stays true as written.

